/**
 * A Texuli design system (ADR-021, formatVersion 1): one closed JSON document a company or an
 * agent writes once and every Texuli surface follows. Data only: colors are hex or numeric oklch,
 * lengths are numbers in px, fonts and assets are same-origin relative paths or capped data URLs,
 * and nothing reaches CSS that the token contract’s css-safe checks would refuse. Generated from
 * `@texuli/spec/design-system`’s vocabulary by scripts/design-system-schema.ts;
 * validateDesignSystem enforces the rules the dialect cannot express.
 */
